<title>UK: Rabobank sets 100 mln rand 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 100 mln rand 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.50     MATURITY    31.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.725   PAY DATE    31.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
